<title>GERMANY: German May import prices rise 0.5 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>German May import prices rise 0.5 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal</p>
<p>Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> GERMAN TRADE PRICES    May 97	Apr 97	May 96</p>
<p>IMPORT prices:</p>
<p>    Monthly figure	  +0.5	 -0.2	 -0.1</p>
<p>    Year-on-year	    +2.8	 +2.1	 +0.7</p>
<p>    Index(base 100 1991) 100.8	100.3	 98.1</p>
<p>EXPORT prices:</p>
<p>    Monthly figure	  +0.2	 +0.3	 +0.1</p>
<p>    Year-on-year	    +1.1	 +1.0	 +0.5</p>
<p>    Index(base 100 1991) 104.9	104.7	103.8</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, 49 228 26097150</p>
</text>
